    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "In a flock of 2650 sheep, 32% have black wool. How many black sheep are there?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "848 black sheep.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}32\\%\\text{ of }2650&=\\frac{32}{100}\\times\\frac{2650}{1}\\\\32\\%\\text{ of }2650&=\\frac{84800}{100}\\\\32\\%\\text{ of }2650&=848\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 848 black sheep.",
